{"id": "hidden-sustenance", "ids": "⿰忄⿱丷⿱冖米", "title": "Hidden Sustenance", "pronunciation": "mì", "bopomofo": "ㄇㄧˋ", "meaning": "The secret comfort found in simple provisions; emotional nourishment through humble means.", "formation": "phono-semantic", "definitions": [{"zh": "藏於內心之糧食安慰", "en": "sustenance hidden within the heart; secret comfort from provisions"}, {"zh": "質樸之物所生溫暖情感", "en": "warm feelings arising from simple, humble things"}, {"zh": "默默珍藏之精神寄託", "en": "spiritual refuge quietly treasured within"}], "etymology": "In the spaces between classical texts, this character should have emerged to capture that particular melancholy of finding profound comfort in the most ordinary provisions. The heart radical embraces rice beneath a protective cover, suggesting how the soul hoards simple sustenance against uncertain times, transforming necessity into tenderness.", "source": {"work": "《集韻》", "gloss": "⿰忄⿱丷⿱冖米，莫計切，心所藏糧也。"}, "components": [{"char": "忄", "meaning": "heart"}, {"char": "丷", "meaning": "丷"}, {"char": "冖", "meaning": "cover"}, {"char": "米", "meaning": "rice"}], "examples": [{"text": "歲荒民困，然母⿰忄⿱丷⿱冖米一簞，足慰三子之心。", "translation": "Though the year was harsh and the people suffered, mother's single basket held secret comfort enough for three children's hearts.", "style": "classical"}, {"text": "每憶童年，祖母廚房中那份⿰忄⿱丷⿱冖米，至今溫暖如昔。", "translation": "Whenever I recall childhood, grandmother's kitchen held that hidden sustenance, still warm as ever today.", "style": "contemporary"}], "related": [{"char": "慰", "pinyin": "wèi", "gloss": "comfort, console"}, {"char": "藏", "pinyin": "cáng", "gloss": "hide, store"}, {"char": "糧", "pinyin": "liáng", "gloss": "grain, provisions"}], "tags": ["sustenance", "comfort", "memory", "simplicity"], "svg": "<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" width=\"512\" height=\"512\">\n<style>@import url(\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Noto+Serif+TC:wght@400;700&display=swap\");</style>\n<g transform=\"transl